# Consultas en plataforma local OHSIRIS validacion de riesgocancer
TITULO	TIPO	BD	CONSULTA
INFORMACION	text		


Análisis propuesto por el nodo coordinador.

Consiste en un análisis de riesgos para la predicción precoz personalizada sobre pacientes con cáncer de pulmón (CP). Concretamente, se predice la probabilidad de diagnóstico de CP durante el seguimiento a partir de los datos basales recogidos durante el periodo de observación. Se ejecuta un análisis de Kaplan-Meier, modelo de riesgos proporcionales de Cox y su versión mediante la regularización Elastic Net.

Metodología:


Se consulta la base de datos local y se extrae la cohorte de pacientes que cumplen con los criterios de inclusión: Pacientes mayores de 18 años, sin diagnóstico de cáncer de pulmón anterior a la fecha índice, con una visita al centro registrada en el año 2020 y 5 años de registros anteriores a dicha fecha índice. Fecha índice: Primera visita hospitalaria o de atención primaria registrada por un paciente que cumple los criterios de inclusión durante el año 2020.

Se crea una nueva tabla en la base de datos local donde se almacenan los datos de la cohorte necesarios para el análisis.

Se ejecuta el análisis mediante una llamada a la API de R y se almacenan los resultados.

ENTRADA	variable	OMOP	WITH params AS (
SELECT
DATE '2020-01-01' AS start_index_date,
DATE '2020-12-31' AS end_index_date,
DATE '2024-11-01' AS admin_censor_date,
2000 AS sample_size,
5 AS prior_observation_years
),

/* 1) Lung Cancer Concepts */
cancer_concepts_full AS (
SELECT concept_id FROM (VALUES (44501357), (44505032), (36560845), (44501585), (36531338), (44502549), (36567582), (37311684), (36552952), (36561283), (36564508), (36520679), (36541364), (36546635), (42511919), (44501404), (44505016), (44500290), (44502329), (36518742), (44499882), (42539251), (4112738), (36523702), (44499889), (44505023), (36560716), (36520748), (36552385), (36532844), (36550126), (44502334), (36536513), (36523365), (44502623), (44505022), (36517902), (36553787), (36528862), (36546130), (36558787), (44500448), (36551240), (36712981), (36543615), (36539915), (36548825), (36543960), (36551818), (36542106), (36527609), (36548193), (36551189), (36526019), (36549979), (36518654), (44502466), (44505024), (44501795), (44502703), (36548626), (44500414), (36530431), (36564925), (36556919), (36532026), (44503034), (36535086), (36567502), (36553794), (36551342), (36533348), (36555776), (36530839), (36521617), (36529004), (36552086), (36536903), (44502784), (1553230), (44502769), (44505018), (36536437), (44499686), (36531120), (36545242), (44503098), (44505033), (44502961), (44502885), (36535081), (44499900), (36538056), (36558877), (36525316), (44503152), (36559892), (44501794), (36566849), (36534932), (36523265), (36566204), (36549769), (36548902), (36555136), (36524040), (44503010), (44505013), (44502436), (44501567), (36541713), (44500287), (36403024), (44503018), (44505021), (36561810), (44500790), (36531901), (44499688), (44499676), (36545372), (36565111), (44501179), (36542965), (36543187), (44504995), (44505001), (44500629), (44502676), (4155293), (40492938), (4162250), (4162248), (4162252), (36547511), (36546260), (36529246), (36529404), (36563697), (36536126), (44505002), (44502764), (44505003), (36567740), (44500114), (36558543), (44503538), (36529581), (36525643), (36520147), (36548953), (36561916), (36551697), (44502949), (44505026), (44499508), (36556614), (36567491), (44499915), (36560854), (36519384), (36547678), (36534747), (36565786), (36558515), (42511851), (4140471), (4143825), (42512311), (36517234), (36552199), (36529740), (36539842), (36537196), (36529691), (44502320), (4110590), (44500541), (44503539), (36544137), (36532996), (44500573), (36560499), (36536786), (36555815), (36545406), (36563276), (36541263), (36549522), (36545761), (36562863), (36558400), (36557699), (44501124), (44500971), (44500918), (44500183), (36565647), (44500841), (36686537), (4110589), (4314040), (4307118), (4312768), (4313751), (36686538), (36524261), (44500359), (44499741), (36565633), (44500356), (36535558), (44501438), (37110033), (4089756), (37110031), (4157333), (4092218), (4092217), (4089754), (37110034), (4151250), (37110032), (4092216), (36545284), (36527781), (36522516), (36522910), (36518733), (36524292), (36550795), (36530810), (36559936), (36567622), (443388), (4110587), (44501612), (36540207), (36552710), (36523996), (36554594), (36526134), (44499898), (36526857), (36540041), (36555685), (36529915), (36564670), (36565803), (36526753), (36549552), (36547828), (36548970), (36522427), (42512265), (42512505), (42512456), (42511962), (42512801), (42512752), (42512246), (42512620), (42512222), (42512380), (42512616), (42512867), (42512859), (42512336), (42512569), (42511979), (42511673), (42511853), (36532293), (36529938), (36563834), (36563105), (36537460), (36567546), (1553314), (42512781), (44502341), (44505030), (44502952), (44502543), (36556450), (44500072), (36520186), (44505029), (44500201), (44501411), (44503093), (44500302), (44500303), (44502876), (44501086), (36565274), (44502109), (44502238), (36558235), (36556496), (42513175), (42513174), (44504994), (44504998), (44499479), (44504990), (44500188), (44505008), (4310703), (4314172), (4311997), (4308479), (44500713), (44501471), (36551824), (44499422), (4115276), (45766129), (45766131), (4208307), (42512043), (42512060), (42511764), (42512203), (42512108), (42511775), (258375), (4110706), (44500415), (44505025), (44500730), (44502943), (36555703), (445021